OL,3,AOasis acoustic guitar sells for record
OL,4,Aprice
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn acoustic guitar played by Noel
OL,7,FGallagher at Oasis's 1996 MTV Unplugged
OL,8,Fgig, and signed by him, has sold at
OL,9,Fauction for #226,800 setting a "world
OL,10,Frecord".
OL,12,FHertfordshire-based Propstore said it
OL,13,Fwas the "highest price achieved at
OL,14,Fauction for an Oasis acoustic guitar".
OL,16,FIt also sold a Yamaha C3 Grand Piano,
OL,17,Ffor #81,900 which was used by Freddie
OL,18,FMercury to compose Crazy Little Thing
OL,19,FCalled Love. It was expected to sell
OL,20,Ffor at least #200,000.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
