OL,3,AOasis acoustic guitar sells for record
OL,4,Aprice
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the first day of its Music Live
OL,7,FAuction on Thursday, the
OL,8,Fhighest-selling lot was a notebook by
OL,9,Fthe Queen frontman which contained
OL,10,Fhandwritten working lyrics and notes
OL,11,Ffrom the Mr. Bad Guy recording
OL,12,Fsessions. It sold for #277,200.
